comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-21T16:30:10.816Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: strict full all-status read inspected 3042/3042 items without omissions. No GH-1535 owner exists. Closed pm-79gv6q fixes summary population counts. This tests-section recurrence belongs under pm-gh1361 and preserves the shipped summary fix."
  "2026-10-21T16:30:40.725Z","harness:codex","Implementation plan: compute test-health counters from the complete matching active population and publish matching_items scope plus total_items. Extend the existing context decision integration fixture for limit, filters, statuses and real CLI/MCP parity. Apply pm-test-audit failing-before and passing-after requirements."
  "2026-10-21T16:38:41.603Z","harness:codex","Regression sensitivity: final test copied unchanged to isolated base 13c19fe9 reports items_with_tests=1 and items_with_recent_runs=0 instead of3 and1 at limit1. Current SDK/CLI/MCP reads pass at limits1/10 with a tag filter, four active items, excluded draft/other-tag items, one failing run and the explicit matching_active_items denominator. Earlier fixture failures were invalid test data (array tag and missing run identity/timestamps), corrected without production workarounds."
  "2026-10-21T17:08:53.242Z","harness:codex","Final linked verification passes46/46 cases, and the graph owner linked suite passes68/68 (111 distinct focused cases across the shared regression file). Typecheck and focused ESLint pass after extracting node projection below the existing complexity ceiling. Real no-Git temporary workspace acceptance reports3 test-bearing items at both focus limits1/10. The qualified packed Node/Bun continuation matrix also passes. Full static and exact-head hosted coverage are still pending at this evidence point."
  "2026-10-21T18:07:27.215Z","harness:codex","Verified Markdown finding with the real CLI: all3 failing IDs were printed at focus limit1. Keep exact population counters and complete structured pre-budget data, but bound Markdown identities by effective focus amount and native token cost and report items_failing_omitted. The regression also covers a one-token detail ceiling that emits no IDs while disclosing all3 omissions. Full-surface source docstrings are added for the touched private helpers."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-21T16:54:03.203Z","harness:codex","Counts shown beside a bounded focus page need an independently declared population. Test health retains active-status semantics but aggregates all matching active items, reports its denominator and ignores focus limits. Seed complete run identity and timestamps in fixtures so persistence normalization cannot remove the intended evidence."
